ns to do. You can go to the gamemode selection and play different minigames, ranging from an intense combat, to a calming collection game. Or, you could go to the collectibles area, which showcases the collectibles you earned throughout these minigames, and some quick games, like a button clicker. You will never be bored when playing Monke Abyss!", "short_description": "Do you want an unforgettable experience? Well look no further than Monke Abyss! This game has action packed adventures awaiting around every corner. There are new gamemodes being uploaded every week including: PVP, Find The Monkes, Only Up, and many more!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monke-abyss-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Landon Corfield", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monke-abyss-privacy-policy/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "30480604101554352"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2408943629468486"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2408943629468486"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1754164800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2408943629468486"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary